# Support — YouStamp AI

Help for creating on-device portraits, stickers, avatars, and GIFs.

## What YouStamp AI does

YouStamp AI uses Apple Intelligence on your device to turn a photo from your library into a portrait, die-cut sticker, profile avatar, or short looping GIF. Generation runs in Apple's Image Playground sheet. Photos are not uploaded to a YouStamp AI server.

## What you need

- iPhone 15 Pro or newer, or an M-series iPad
- iOS or iPadOS 18.1 or later
- Apple Intelligence turned on in Settings
- A clear photo of a person

The iOS Simulator cannot run this model. Use a supported physical device.

## How to create

1. Open the Create tab and pick a photo.
2. Choose Portrait, Sticker, Avatar, or GIF. For GIF, pick a motion such as Bounce or Wiggle.
3. Choose a style (Realistic is the default) or type your own description.
4. Tap Generate. Confirm the result in Image Playground.
5. When it saves, YouStamp AI opens Gallery on that creation.

## Credits and Pro

New installs include 10 free generations. Each save uses one credit unless you subscribe to Pro. You can buy credit packs (10, 50, or 150) or Pro monthly / yearly. Restore purchases from Settings if you reinstall.

Subscriptions auto-renew unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the period ends in your Apple ID subscription settings. Manage or cancel in Settings → Apple ID → Subscriptions.

