## Common issues

**Generate is unavailable.** The device must support Apple Intelligence, and it must be enabled. After turning it on, wait until Apple finishes downloading the on-device models.

**The GIF looks still, or an old GIF looks wrong.** Image Playground returns one still frame. YouStamp AI then builds the looping GIF. Create a new GIF to use the latest animation. Items already in Gallery are not re-encoded.

**It doesn't look like the person.** Keep Realistic selected, use a sharp, well-lit face photo, and confirm the photo is attached in Image Playground before you generate. Apple's on-device styles are illustration, animation, and sketch — not a real camera photo.

**Photos permission.** YouStamp AI asks for Photo Library access so you can pick a source picture and save results. You can change this in Settings → Privacy & Security → Photos.

